#: src/postulo/plugins/register_lookup/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Look a company up in its country's register when you press for it, from its register number (France, Norway, Finland, Czechia, Poland) or its LEI (GLEIF), and choose which of the official name, address, state and activity to keep. One request per press, carrying the number and nothing else, to the register's own service, which so learns which company somebody here is looking at. Off until an administrator switches it on; switched off, nothing is asked and nothing already kept is touched."
msgstr "Tschertga in'interpresa en il register da ses pajais, sche Vus al dumandais, a basa da ses numer da register (Frantscha, Norvegia, Finlanda, Tschechia, Pologna) u da ses LEI (GLEIF), e Vus laschais tscherner tge che duai vegnir conservà dal num uffizial, da l'adressa, dal stadi giuridic e da l'activitad. Ina dumonda per clic, cun il numer e nagut auter, al servetsch dal register sez, che vegn uschia a savair tge interpresa ch'insatgi qua guarda. Deactivà fin ch'in administratur l'activescha; deactivà, na vegn dumandà nagut e nagut che vegn gia conservà na vegn tutgà."

#: src/postulo/plugins/register_lookup/adapters.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "National Court Register (KRS), Ministry of Justice of Poland"
msgstr "Register naziunal giudizial (KRS), Ministeri da giustia da la Pologna"

#: src/postulo/plugins/register_lookup/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Register lookup"
msgstr "Tschertga en registers"

#: src/postulo/plugins/register_lookup/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Which registers Register lookup can ask, one per country, and how each one's answer is read: the Annuaire des Entreprises (France), Enhetsregisteret (Norway), YTJ (Finland), ARES (Czechia), KRS (Poland) and GLEIF. Nothing here asks anything by itself."
msgstr "Tge registers che Tschertga en registers po dumandar, in per pajais, e co che la resposta da mintgin vegn legida: l'Annuaire des Entreprises (Frantscha), l'Enhetsregisteret (Norvegia), il YTJ (Finlanda), l'ARES (Tschechia), il KRS (Pologna) ed il GLEIF. Nagut qua na dumonda insatge da sasez."
